    "title": "Eyedid SDK Demo",
    "description": "Try simple and easy eye tracking demo from your android devices.\r\n- Real-time gaze path follows where you are looking at\r\n- Start quick 5 point calibration. \r\n- Load the calibration data without re-do the process.  \r\n** Only 'portrait mode' is supported for this demo \r\n\r\nIf you like this demo, download SeeSo SDK and develop your own eye tracking app!\r\n- Get SDK: https://sdk.eyedid.ai/\r\n- Docs: https://docs.eyedid.ai/nonversioning/quick-start/android-quick-start\r\n\r\nFor more information, \r\n- Business inquiry: contactus@eyedid.ai\r\n- Development inquiry: development@eyedid.ai",
